-f891804b-1341-4bdd-9126-2f53b2fd0113"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"dd28fcce7d5ca23e8179c03135d7507eb4717edee3da2093041e076c467b1527","event_uuid":"f3be9eda-0613-4e5f-97d8-5fc5e3d91a87","position":{"commit_sha":"9cd36119ff838d43ce7d99bacc3d0938e4bc96d6","position":"1786732671649043001-f3be9eda-0613-4e5f-97d8-5fc5e3d91a87"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"afffcf0f80beb849cb66b828093eadcc12514778f2b511bb841ffe099994b03a","event_uuid":"1787c347-12ca-4ebf-846a-2c2cab7660a6","position":{"commit_sha":"642fa1982d26a615a8015f8f6197e18b862a5efb","position":"1786732673676045001-1787c347-12ca-4ebf-846a-2c2cab7660a6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"regression","comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Root-cause note (regression origin):\n\nThe J11 store-copy fixture (dc_store_copy_repo in tests/external/live_jira_dc/_dc_fixtures.py) scrubs .bridge_state*, commits the scrubbed tree, then calls run_ensures() to converge the git-archive copy into a writable store (needed for the .env-id store marker).\n\nrun_ensures runs the 'projects-seed' ensure unit (rebar._store.project_ensures.seed_projects_mapping_unit), added by commit 72731d3745 on 2026-08-13 (ticket 462d / epic 0303). That unit's tree-check is 'git show tickets:.bridge_state/projects.json'; when it misses — exactly the state the scrub leaves — it re-creates AND commits .bridge_state/projects.json. So convergence silently resurrects the very cache the scrub removed, and the isolation cell then sees .bridge_state survive.\n\nThe scrub itself (2026-08-07, epic e369) predates that seed unit, and before epic 0303 run_ensures created nothing under .bridge_state, so the scrub held. This is a pure ordering regression: a new unconditional ensure unit re-introduced an artifact after the one-shot scrub.\n\nFix: extract scrub_bridge_state(tracker, *, commit=False); re-run it (with commit=True) AFTER run_ensures so the resurrected .bridge_state/projects.json is removed from worktree and tickets tree. Principled (re-scrub the whole .bridge_state* glob) rather than special-casing one filename; keeps .env-id intact. Pinned by a fast repo-tier regression test that drives the real seed unit as a negative control.","timestamp":1786728067904079001}],"created_at":1786720415815192001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"5b7052b9-32a1-4534-ba0a-df29e0c448e4","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"708d-0767-1a51-4928"},{"link_uuid":"61156ccf-fad5-4fe2-8a95-81ae0d0681df","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"b0d9-211c-58f8-4b70"},{"link_uuid":"f0af90aa-4818-465f-b088-ef64719afe81","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"164e-d900-07ea-4b3c"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe live Jira DC harness cell `tests/external/live_jira_dc/test_store_copy_isolation.py::test_the_store_copy_is_complete_and_scrubbed` FAILS on current origin/main:\n\n    AssertionError: binding/snapshot artifacts survived the scrub: ['.bridge_state']\n\nObserved in the 'jira DC harness smoke' job of Live External Integration run 31807853902 (job 94790999602), 2026-08-14, against origin/main. The J11 store-copy fixture scrubs `.bridge_state*` from the copied store, but the artifact survives into the copy the isolation cell asserts is fully scrubbed, muddying the live DC signal for unrelated work.\n\n## Root cause (regression origin)\nThe `dc_store_copy_repo` fixture (`tests/external/live_jira_dc/_dc_fixtures.py`) scrubs `.bridge_state*`, commits, and THEN calls `run_ensures()` to converge the `git archive` copy into a writable store. Commit 72731d3745 (2026-08-13, ticket 462d / epic 0303) added the `projects-seed` ensure unit (`rebar._store.project_ensures.seed_projects_mapping_unit`), which unconditionally re-creates and COMMITS `.bridge_state/projects.json` whenever its tree-check (`git show tickets:.bridge_state/projects.json`) misses — which is exactly the state the scrub leaves. That seed unit post-dates the J11 scrub (2026-08-07), so converging the copy silently resurrects the cache the scrub had removed. Before epic 0303, `run_ensures` created nothing under `.bridge_state`, so the scrub held.\n\n## Approach\nExtract the scrub into a small module-level helper `scrub_bridge_state(tracker, *, commit=False)` in `_dc_fixtures.py` (glob-matched, as before). Call it in the original position, and AGAIN after `run_ensures` converges the store — this second pass commits the removal so the `projects-seed` unit's resurrected `.bridge_state/projects.json` is removed from both the worktree and the tickets tree. This is a principled fix (re-scrub the whole `.bridge_state*` glob after convergence) rather than special-casing one filename, and it keeps the `.env-id` store marker that `run_ensures` creates intact.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/external/live_jira_dc/_dc_fixtures.py` — add `scrub_bridge_state` helper; re-scrub after `run_ensures`.\n- `tests/unit/test_dc_store_copy_fetch_diagnostics.py` — add a fast repo-tier regression test: the `projects-seed` unit resurrects `.bridge_state/projects.json`, and the committing re-scrub removes it (worktree + tickets tree).\n\n## Testing\n- Fast unit test (`TestBridgeStateScrub`) drives the real `seed_projects_mapping_unit` to reproduce the resurrection (negative control) and asserts the post-converge scrub leaves no `.bridge_state*` and a clean git tree — no live harness needed.\n- The live cell `test_the_store_copy_is_complete_and_scrubbed` is the ultimate check; it runs in the operator-dispatched DC-harness job (~1h), not a per-commit gate.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] The store-copy scrub removes `.bridge_state` (and any equivalent binding/snapshot cache) so `test_the_store_copy_is_complete_and_scrubbed` passes in the live DC-harness job — verified by the re-scrub after `run_ensures` and the fast unit regression test in `tests/unit/test_dc_store_copy_fetch_diagnostics.py` (Gerrit change 1783 / commit 716454cbe5, merged). [operator-attested] live DC-harness confirmation is deferred to the operator's next dispatched run.\n- [x] A root-cause note explains why `.bridge_state` began surviving the scrub (regression origin) — recorded in this description (## Root cause) and as a ticket comment.\n\n## Notes\nIndependent of the rich-text epic (vigilant-erasable-pony); does NOT touch `test_dc_rich_text_live.py` (owned concurrently by graywolf-land).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_dc/_dc_fixtures.py","reason":"add scrub_bridge_state helper; re-scrub .bridge_state after run_ensures converges the copy"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_dc_store_copy_fetch_diagnostics.py","reason":"fast repo-tier regression test for the post-converge scrub"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","164e-d900-07ea-4b3c"],["relates_to","b0d9-211c-58f8-4b70"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"f3be9eda-0613-4e5f-97d8-5fc5e3d91a87","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"91aa-167f-1061-4f17","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Live DC store-copy scrub leaves .bridge_state behind (test_store_copy_isolation regression)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["d0df00a7-4870-4367-bab5-cf556e5d6cfe","cdefa6b6-9cea-4a68-9a07-dd17f55371d4","1ff7924f-9e9f-45b7-bc9e-292a2acc8ab4","a1fcab50-0ba7-4f80-875c-74f63abf6d5e","4199012e-a96e-4610-8a26-ee24212cab83","5e5664d0-fa6e-4ada-a514-0092f16d0fb0","61156ccf-fad5-4fe2-8a95-81ae0d0681df","f0af90aa-4818-465f-b088-ef64719afe81","f891804b-1341-4bdd-9126-2f53b2fd0113","f3be9eda-0613-4e5f-97d8-5fc5e3d91a87","1787c347-12ca-4ebf-846a-2c2cab7660a6"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786736355334269001,"uuid":"4abae60b-00dd-4b7b-afd9-21b1904a2c4e"}